{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>First time</b><br>Like the apple-tree. [This is] the name of the tree." "<b>Second time</b><br>She answered: Like the apple-tree that is in the garden among [other] trees, so is my beloved and my desire to him." "<b>Third time</b><br>Congregation of Israel said: Are you not my El? And you are likened in the eyes of Egypt to an apple. And when will the end arrive, that I may sit in your shadow, and that you may bring me to a land flowing with milk and honey and abundance of grain and wine?"], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:43:56.358103279Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}